<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Animate Dead</h1>
<p>Sphere: Creation Sphere
Spell Tier: 1
Class: Necromancer (guild level 4)
Mana: 20
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cast animate dead &lt;corpse&gt;
tell zombie &lt;command&gt;
tell horde &lt;command&gt;     (all your zombies and skeletons at once)
</pre>
<p>The necromancer cuts their own skin, bleeds on a corpse and chants 'Muera 
aneme', and the corpse rises as a zombie that follows its maker. The 
zombie carries whatever the corpse held. Command it with tell: it can walk, 
fight (<a cmd='#'>tell zombie kill rat</a>), get, drop, give and put things, follow, 
flee, dig, bury, climb, enter, rest, sit, sleep, wake and stand. Anything 
else, it only moans.
</p><p>The zombie lasts a few minutes, up to a quarter of an hour for a master, 
then crumbles to dust, leaving behind what it carried. A strong dispel 
magic ends it sooner. It never attacks players, unless both you and they 
have signed the Book of Blood.
</p><p>Only corpses of monsters will rise: a player's corpse won't. Corpses of 
insects and other crawling things, of the undead, demons and devils, 
elementals, golems, gargoyles and the like crumble to dust instead. You must 
be standing, and no free hands are needed. It is also found on wands, 
staffs and scrolls.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Control Undead</a>
